WEBVTT

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.450
You use this equation...

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.200
Like this... See? Isn't that simple?

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.400
What's so simple about it?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.870
Nagisa!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.140
Not here!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.540
I'm so hungry I think I'm going to die mepo.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.840
I'm trying desperately hard to study...

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.820
It's time for a snack mepo.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.270
It's warm today, so soft ice 
cream would be good mepo.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:46.950
And I'd like a chocolate parfait and a 
strawberry sundae to go with it mepo.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.700
I guess it can't be helped.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.720
After you eat it, you'd better be quiet.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.230
Thank you for waiting...

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.810
Here's your delicious sweets set, sir.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:03.900
Thank you mepo!

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.050
Share some with Mipple.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.250
Oops! Sorry...

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.680
We'll just get him to bring another set mepo.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.120
Next I'll have a banana 
shake and a cream soda...

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.990
That's enough!

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:28.970
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:31.770
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:34.610
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.880
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:41.850
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.720
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.620
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:50.520
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.120
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.930
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.030
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:03.800
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.810
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.380
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.540
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.410
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:22.690
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:23.590
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:26.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.000
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.560
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.630
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.020
What are you doing?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:47.650
Get me all seven Prism Stones!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.920
Power... I want power!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.730
I want the Power of Creation!

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:58.560
Once I have that in my 
possession, I'll be complete.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.220
I will live forever!

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.490
It was a real surprise this 
last time when we were drawn

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:13.980
into some unknown place 
during our midterm test...

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:21.740
I wonder how we were saved that time.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.810
Could it be that someone saved us?

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.590
Who cares? As long as we were saved.

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:30.280
Nagisa!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.460
Honoka!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.130
That smells so good.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.960
I'd like to eat some hot, fluffy bread mepo.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.570
Are you going to eat again?

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:47.850
Don't pop up all of a sudden 
and talk in a place like this!

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:52.050
I'm happiest when I'm eating mepo.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.010
Mepple... you've been acting 
strange lately mipo.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.290
What do you mean by strange mepo?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.080
All you talk about is eating mipo.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.610
I have to agree with you.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.380
That's true.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:09.110
But I can't help it if I'm hungry mepo!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.400
Have you forgotten who you are mipo?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.940
You're the Chosen Guardian 
of the Field of Light mipo!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.150
And you seem to have forgotten 
what the Guardian's mission is,

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.400
and you've gotten lazy mipo!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.710
I'm not lazy! I'm just taking 
my time to get ready mepo!

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.920
If you don't understand that,

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.410
then you can't call yourself 
the Princess of Hope mepo!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.380
What do you mean by that mipo?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:34.850
You don't have the kindness 
to give hope to everyone mepo.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:39.330
Mepple... is that how you thought of me mipo?

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.850
You made a fool of me, too, mepo.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.610
No, I didn't mipo.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:49.880
I just want the Field of Light to 
return to what it used to be mipo...

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:54.290
I wanted the Field of Light to go back 
to what it was before Dotsuku Zone came,

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.830
and destroyed everything, so I can 
live with everyone again mipo.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:05.050
What are you thinking anyway, Mepple mipo?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.290
You got Mipple angry!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.930
Don't blame me mepo!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:21.100
"TOO SCARY! DOTSUKU ZONE'S FINAL TRUMP CARD"

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:25.540
I guess it's time for dinner, isn't it?

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.550
I don't want to eat mepo.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.130
It's unusual for you to say that, Mepple...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.740
Do you have a fever?

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.770
Leave me alone mepo!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:39.990
By any chance, are you worried 
about what happened with Mipple?

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.280
I don't blame Mipple for getting angry mepo.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:50.290
I agree. It's only natural that she wants 
to go back to your own world again.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:54.210
The Field of Light used to be 
a really beautiful place mepo.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:58.600
At least until it was attacked by 
the dark powers of Dotsuku Zone.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.900
Doesn't the power of darkness 
annihilate everything?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:08.620
That's right. If all seven of the 
Prism Stones are taken away,

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.550
we'll lose the power to 
protect the Field of Light,

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.180
and the field of Light will disappear mepo.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:19.330
So because you and Mipple managed 
to escape with two of the stones,

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.480
the Field of Light was saved, wasn't it?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.920
It was a really close call mepo.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:29.490
When Dotsuku Zone comes after 
you, it annihilates everything,

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.130
leaving nothing but darkness behind mepo.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:36.110
And no new life will be 
created from there mepo.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:41.090
That's why we have to do everything in our 
power to protect the Prism Stones mipo.

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.610
I can understand how you feel,

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.430
but you might have gone a little too far

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:49.060
when you told Mepple that he 
wasn't acting like a guardian.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.340
I think so, too mipo.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:57.850
Just as Mipple said, I want the Field 
of Light to go back to the way it was,

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.020
so we can live with everyone again mepo.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.800
Do you mean that if you 
have all seven Prism Stones

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.990
that the Field of Light will 
go back to the way it was?

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:06.750
That's right mepo.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.360
If we have all seven Prism Stones together,

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.640
then it will bring forth 
the Power of Creation and

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:17.560
everything will go back to the way 
it was in the Field of Light mepo.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.950
The Power of Creation really 
is awesome, isn't it?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:27.410
There's a similar power here in the 
Field of Rainbows where you live mepo.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.420
Here in this world?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.540
Individually, they may be small,

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:37.150
but the spirit that people have, the will 
to live that animals and flowers have,

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:41.850
and energy like that are a part 
of the power of creation mepo.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.390
That might have been a little 
hard for your mind to grasp mepo.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.690
Wait a minute! What do you mean by that?

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:53.360
Anyway, I feel the same way 
about getting the Field of Light

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.230
back to the way it was 
as soon as possible mepo.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.730
I hope it happens soon, too.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:04.130
According to the legend, the Princess 
of Hope and the Chosen Guardian

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:07.550
worked together to find the 
legendary warriors mepo.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.700
If we all work together, 
it'll all work out mepo.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:16.880
The Princess of Hope is Mipple, and 
you're the Chosen Guardian, aren't you?

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:21.110
That's right. And Pretty Cure 
are the legendary warriors mepo.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:26.120
But if the Princess of Hope and 
the Chosen Guardian are fighting,

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.640
then doesn't that put the future in danger?

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:30.250
Don't say that mepo.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:38.330
Good morning!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.850
That's right...

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.140
What's wrong?

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:48.660
Mepple is worried about 
what happened yesterday.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.610
I see! We have to get them 
to make up, don't we?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.450
Didn't you have something 
to say to Mipple, Mepple?

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.340
Mipple...?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:05.080
Did you want something mipo?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:11.080
Why don't you just come right 
out, and say you're sorry?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.020
Why do I have to apologize mepo?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.100
Mipple is the one who said I wasn't 
acting like a guardian mepo!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.280
And you said that I wasn't acting 
like the Princess of Hope, too mipo!

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.360
It's not good to hold grudges forever mepo!

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.300
You're the one holding grudges mipo!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:33.770
That's right! After all, I'm not acting 
like a guardian, so I'm cowardly mepo.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.020
You're a lowlife mipo!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.090
Why does it turn out like this?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.440
Look at that, Nagisa!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.590
What is this anyway?

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:52.970
What's going on?

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.720
Honoka! Look at the flowers!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.970
What in the world is going on here?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.690
What is this a sign of?

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.110
The air is freezing...

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.880
And this tension.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:15.620
It can't be...!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.420
Ilkubo...!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.940
There's more there than I thought...

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:31.400
Even if it's small, it'll make 
a nice gift for Jyaku-King.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.290
How could everything turn like this?

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.760
It's the worst presence 
I've felt so far mepo.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.060
Does this mean that this is 
Dotsuku Zone's doing, too?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.760
There's no mistake about it mepo.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:01.940
There's someone there.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.130
Are you the ones?

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.580
I asked if you're the ones!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.720
What's this overpowering feeling?

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.130
What's that ball?

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.510
It seems like something's 
gathered over there.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:11.380
It's sucked up all of the power of life 
and energy from the Field of Rainbows.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.430
You've saved me the trouble...

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:18.880
Hand over the Prism Stones.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.490
This is terrible!

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:22.520
He's different from the ones we've 
been up against until now mepo!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:23.830
He's right mipo!

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.320
He's too much for us to handle mipo.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:31.310
But we can't just let him get away 
with doing this to us, can we?

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.770
You're right.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.710
Ready?

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:43.400
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.640
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.380
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.010
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.860
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.080
Go back to where you came from!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.890
If I'm going to do it, I won't hold back.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.360
Don't let your guards down mepo!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.850
I know!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.180
Black!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:44.300
I told you... I'm not going to hold back.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.640
How dare you do that to Black!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:51.800
White!

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.950
It's useless! There's too much 
difference in our powers.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.350
Ready?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.530
Are you okay mepo?

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.170
Pull yourselves together mipo!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.230
It's no good...

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.050
He's too strong.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.860
We're no match for him!

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:18.000
For the time-being, it might be 
a good idea to run away mepo.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.980
That's a good idea mipo.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.350
But we can't run away from this, can we?

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:27.240
We have to do something.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.050
Black!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:37.250
White!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.390
We have...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.130
...to do something!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.630
This is the final blow!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:06.750
I'm going to take all of your power of light.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.310
What is this horrible feeling...?

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:21.660
It feels like all of the strength 
in my body is being drained...

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:26.370
He's trying to suck up all the power of 
light from Pretty Cure with that ball mepo!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.690
That's not possible!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.670
You've transformed back to normal mipo!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.120
It can't be!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.130
Can this be...?

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:57.680
Just what you'd expect 
from the power of light.

00:15:58.030 --> 00:15:59.590
It's incredible.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:03.860
But now it's in my hands.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:08.310
Eventually, I'll have everything in my hands.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.110
Give up, and hand over the Prism Stones!

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.350
I don't have...

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.610
...any strength left.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:18.820
I can't move...

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:22.130
We may not be able to do anything mipo.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:28.320
We can't run away or fight anymore mipo.

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:30.480
What are you saying mepo?

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.330
You must never say that, Mipple mepo.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:39.200
You're the Princess of Hope mepo!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:43.310
If the Princess of Hope loses hope, 
what will happen to everyone mepo!

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:45.680
That will really be the end mepo!

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:50.650
But I really don't know what to do mipo!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.080
Nagisa! Honoka! Take 
Mipple and run away mepo!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.120
I'll figure out how to 
deal with that guy mepo!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.360
You can't...! It's impossible.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:03.090
How are you going to fight 
him by yourself, Mepple?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:08.040
I'll... I'll figure something out mepo!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.100
In the worst case, I'll just 
hand over my Prism Stone,

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.870
so the three of you run away mepo!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.480
Then I will, too mipo.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.430
What are you saying mepo?

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:20.870
If you're gone, the Field of 
Light will lose all hope mepo.

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:24.890
You, Nagisa and Honoka have to get away mepo!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:30.080
But without you, we can't transform, Mepple.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.060
That's right.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.570
Even if you can't transform,

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.570
just having you both by her side 
will give Mipple support mepo.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.030
So the three of you have to get away mepo!

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:42.300
I can't go on without you, Mepple mipo!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:46.740
You're the one I care about the most mipo!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.760
I'm the Chosen Guardian mepo.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:52.530
I'm the one who has to protect you,

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.510
Nagisa and Honoka mepo!

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:59.680
I will protect the three of you mepo!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.420
Mepple!

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:06.650
I'm going to protect you mepo!

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.530
Mepple!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.230
I'm going to protect you mepo!

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:13.900
I'm going to protect you mepo!

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:17.450
What is this?

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.430
I'm going to protect you all mepo!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:48.980
The power of light has 
returned to Pretty Cure mepo!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.560
It can't be!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.690
I never thought I would 
lose to the power of light.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.110
What is this?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.220
It feels warm.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.520
The power of the Field of 
Rainbows is on your side mipo!

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.500
Ready, White?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.420
Black Thunder!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.840
White Thunder!

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:30.090
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.850
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.460
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.630
It's awesome mepo!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.450
With added power of the Field of Rainbows,

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.430
you've gained awesome power mepo!

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:54.730
Did he...

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:55.620
...stop our Marble Screw?

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:57.060
Hang in there mepo!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.390
Don't give up mipo!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.560
All right!

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.560
We did it!

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.270
Where is he?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.190
He disappeared!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.880
What a surprise!

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.020
I didn't know anyone like that existed.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.650
What's going to happen from here on?

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:58.340
If we all put our power together, 
we'll be able to manage somehow mipo.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.690
You're right mepo.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:04.430
Mepple.. I have to apologize to you mipo...

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:07.080
For saying that you're not 
acting like a guardian...

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.600
No, you don't mepo!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.980
I should be the one to apologize first mepo.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.050
I'm sorry, Mipple.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:17.010
I'm sorry, too mipo.

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:20.520
But Mepple really was something, wasn't he?

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:24.230
Just what you'd expect 
from the Chosen Guardian.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:28.290
I only found the courage 
because Mipple, Nagisa and you

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.710
were there mepo.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:34.030
Mepple! I love you mipo!

00:21:35.170 --> 00:21:37.460
I love you, too mepo!

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:41.460
It's no good unless Mepple and 
Mipple are acting like this, is it?

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.000
Mipple!

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:45.340
Mepple!

00:21:57.140 --> 00:22:00.850
I didn't realize how powerful 
the power of light was...

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:05.280
Don't tell me that they've grown...?

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:55.400
Two Honokas?

00:23:55.400 --> 00:23:56.760
What's going on?

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.150
I'm the real one.

00:23:58.150 --> 00:23:59.990
No, I am.

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:02.060
Even their voices are the same.

00:24:02.060 --> 00:24:04.260
Nagisa! Why can't you tell that one of us

00:24:04.260 --> 00:24:05.680
is an assassin from Dotsuku Zone?

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:08.590
I can't help it if I can't 
tell the difference!

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:11.770
I won't forgive you for posing as Honoka!

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:15.670
"WHICH IS THE REAL ONE? 
THERE ARE TWO HONOKAS"

00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:18.180
All I have to do is take one to taste 
chocolate, and I can tell the difference.

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.000
You mean I'm less than a piece of chocolate?
